# The brace-expansion DoS advisories (GHSA-q2hr-2g5m-vwhr / GHSA-qhr7-859c-m2p7 /
# GHSA-6j4f-fj2g-mc7p) came from a copy bundled inside aws-cdk-lib's minimatch,
# which npm overrides cannot reach. Fixed in aws-cdk-lib 2.273.0.
#
# The sprintf-js advisory (GHSA-hp3w-g68c-fv3c) in the dev-only Jest coverage
# chain is handled by the "overrides" entry in package.json, which moves
# @istanbuljs/load-nyc-config to js-yaml 4 (no argparse@1 / sprintf-js).
# Remove that override once @istanbuljs/load-nyc-config depends on js-yaml 4.
#
# `npm audit` runs at its default level; do not set audit-level here.
